<mxCell id="c11" value="* Carrier-dependent security: TLS protects SIP signalling; SRTP protects the phone media leg. WebRTC media uses DTLS-SRTP. Codecs / sample rates negotiated by media and SDK layers." style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="250" width="1180" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
